        "color_scheme": "scheme-2a55a678-5be1-415f-983d-14d07040ce40",
        "headline": "our story",
        "headline_color": "#ffffff",
        "rich_text": "<p>Rabbit Hole Cakes is run by Lee and Emma, a family team based in Perth with a passion for creating bakes that stand out. From wedding cakes that take centre stage to brownies, cookies and traybakes that elevate everyday moments, everything we make is crafted with care, creativity and bold flavour.</p><p>Our dedication to quality has been recognised with a number of industry awards, reflecting the creativity and craftsmanship behind every recipe.</p><p>We’re proud to have worked with leading companies including Three, Apple, SSE and Miller Homes, as well as showcasing our bakes at major events such as the Royal Highland Show, Ideal Home Show, Scottish Game Fair, Blair Horse Trials and Perth Show.</p><p>Behind every product is a commitment to sourcing with integrity. We use the highest quality ingredients, choosing local suppliers wherever possible. Our chocolate and cocoa are Fairtrade, our eggs are free range, and every bake is made with real butter. In our shop, you’ll also find speciality coffee from Unorthodox Roasters in Kinross, teas from The Wee Tea Company in Dunfermline, and bubble tea from Tempo Tea in Glasgow.</p><p>At heart, Rabbit Hole Cakes is about more than baking. It’s about creating memorable moments, celebrating life’s milestones, and sharing joy, one slice at a time.</p>",
        "button_link": "",
